    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "evidence_t",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 255,
      "text": "MEMORY IMAGE HEADER — challenge/runtime knobs\n\nnano challenge: layers=2 · d_model=64 · vocab=512 · max_seq=64\nKDA H=2 dh=32 · MLA H=2 · experts=8 · top-k=2 · shared=1\nHeader exposes vocab, dimensions, layer bitmap and descriptor addresses.\n\nREAL KIMI K3: layers=93 · d_model=7168 · vocab=160K\n69 KDA + 24 Gated MLA · experts=896 · top-16 + shared=2\n\nCritical: msh_lg is physically 128×128b = 512 int32 logits.\nK3 needs 40,000 words (312.5× depth); GEMV ACC_LANES is also 512.\n→ The header can say 160K, but this RTL cannot execute it unchanged.",
      "originalText": "MEMORY IMAGE HEADER — challenge/runtime knobs\n\nnano challenge: layers=2 · d_model=64 · vocab=512 · max_seq=64\nKDA H=2 dh=32 · MLA H=2 · experts=8 · top-k=2 · shared=1\nHeader exposes vocab, dimensions, layer bitmap and descriptor addresses.\n\nREAL KIMI K3: layers=93 · d_model=7168 · vocab=160K\n69 KDA + 24 Gated MLA · experts=896 · top-16 + shared=2\n\nCritical: msh_lg is physically 128×128b = 512 int32 logits.\nK3 needs 40,000 words (312.5× depth); GEMV ACC_LANES is also 512.\n→ The header can say 160K, but this RTL cannot execute it unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 30003,
      "version": 1,
